FAIL testdata/bad/unknown-need.yaml:7:13  PQ2002: step "transform" needs "extrct", and no step is called that

   5 |   - name: transform
   6 |     run: ["/bin/true"]
>  7 |     needs: [extrct]
                   ^

   Did you mean "extract"?

       needs: [extract]

   The steps in this job are: extract, transform.

   needs is the job's dependency graph: this step waits until every step it
   names has succeeded, and is skipped if one of them fails. Written order only
   breaks ties between steps that are ready together.

   paceq error PQ2002  for the full explanation
